{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2014-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1388534400, "end_date": 1389139199, "month_true_total": 67, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:48:21 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "8602703", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035990705", "personaname": "snowyonetwo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198035990705/", "num_games_owned": 1082, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 1217, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 598, "last_played": 1396660055, "avatar": "6889e542266ff1eca9c32d7f405a723a0e19f756"}, "language": "english", "review": "If Space Marine had been any other, cover-based, shooter, it would not be worthy of note. However, this game, in my eyes, stands out a heavy cut above the rest as it showcases exactly what's wrong with the current trend in gaming. I could rag on it for some clipping issues and technical glitches, but then I would go back to reminding myself that this is a game so fun and over the top that the proper response to an enemy charging head-long at you is to charge right back at him and wrestle him down before decapitating him with your chain-sword to regain health. We need more games like this, badly, and that's not to mention things like the fact that the main character is actually a respectable and admirable human being as opposed to the scowling space marine of so many other shooters. A solid 8/10 just for the sheer amount of bloody awesome it manages to have, especially in a market flooded with cover-based shooters.", "timestamp_created": 1389082986, "timestamp_updated": 1389082986, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8600621", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013809068", "personaname": "F0X", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/007cfox/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 517, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 517, "last_played": 1385593115, "avatar": "5d53d29775510366035a06d7410e7fb7112aefad"}, "language": "english", "review": "Short game, about 8 hours, the first few hours are kind of boring, but once I passed the half way point I was having a blast. There is a point where I had a sledgehammer and jetpack, it was like being Thor and IronMan at the same time, amazing. The gameplay is pretty fun. The story is kind of boring and predictable, I haven't played any of the warhammer games so I don't know all the lore but it was a fun enough game to finish it.", "timestamp_created": 1389066184, "timestamp_updated": 1389066184, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8589991", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971213277", "personaname": "Wraith", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197971213277/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1159, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1111, "last_played": 1673432363, "avatar": "bbfe85daccfef3b01e010a1316ed9db4df50cbe6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Still a classic...", "timestamp_created": 1389009915, "timestamp_updated": 1389009915, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8586297", "author": {"steamid": "76561198068216607", "personaname": "Mapache", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198068216607/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 116, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 35, "last_played": 1389935234, "avatar": "952f0d3d8a962d035bc97eb208364d71c22f417e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Blood+Action = Nice game", "timestamp_created": 1388984897, "timestamp_updated": 1388984897, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8584649", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029478045", "personaname": "Foxxy Renamon", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FoxxyRenamon/", "num_games_owned": 314, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 5516, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5268, "last_played": 1646638030, "avatar": "0c011d04b76dd54eaf208d027bd7a162d3e1bd85"}, "language": "english", "review": "I would recomend this game, as it is from an amazing company that makes incredible games. \n\nHowever, the online in this game is dead. It takes roughly ten minutes to find a match, and when you find a match, it is either full of AFK people, or a team of Over the top gamers that you have no chance against. \n\nAll the DLC playlists are empty, and even Exterminatus mode is dead. \n\n10/10 For story and Graphics.\n0/10 For Online and Community.", "timestamp_created": 1388974458, "timestamp_updated": 1389109725, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 19, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520547091960906982", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "